{"id":"jr4sbug32it9jikl4lkeankqe","title":"欧盟拟立法规范网络交易行为，违规企业最高面临全球营收6%罚款","originalTitle":null,"summary":"欧盟委员会提出《数字公平法案》草案，禁止欺骗性界面设计和动态定价等不公平交易行为，违规企业最高面临全球年度总营业额6%的罚款。法案还要求企业为用户提供关闭数字产品成瘾性设计的选项，并提高网红博主透明度。草案需在未来数月内获得欧盟各成员国及欧洲议会批准。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"华尔街见闻"},"links":{"original":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3785761"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T21:27:25.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T21:35:33.864Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T21:35:33.864Z","category":"crypto-policy","tags":["监管处罚","政策发布"],"score":40,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}